{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "37b4baeb-5863-8b37-b68c-86d8c463f8d7",
  "created_at": "2026-02-24T12:37:01-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dennis Reardon",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:32:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:32:13-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. Dennis Reardon. Calling about water in the street. Storm drain in front of my house isn't taking anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:32:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm sorry about that. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:32:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "226 Annandale Road. North End. Down toward the end, couple houses before the corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:32:35-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 226 Annandale. And is this from the storm over the weekend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:32:42-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, last weekend's nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday. That's two days ago now. Rain stopped Sunday, water's still sitting there. Street in front of the house is a pond. Real pond."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:32:56-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh boy. So it's still standing right now, Tuesday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:33:01-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right now. I'm looking at it out the window. Cars come through, throw a wake right up on the lawn. Like a boat going by."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:33:13-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wow. Is it getting into your house or yard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:33:18-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yard, yeah. Not the house, not yet. But that's not the point. Drain's clogged or backed up or something. Leaves, mud, I don't know. Nobody's come look at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:33:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Has anyone reported it before, that you know of?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:33:37-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Don't know who called. I figured somebody must have. Been sitting two days. Shouldn't take a phone call from me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:33:47-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you're right, and I appreciate you calling anyway. I'll put in a work order for that drain so a crew can check it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:33:59-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Because it's not just the water. Lot of kids walk through here, going to the bus. And people with dogs, all day long. They walk right at the edge. Car comes by fast, somebody gets soaked or worse."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:34:17-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a good point, I'll note the pedestrian concern on the order. Is the water deep, would you say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:34:26-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Over the curb. Maybe six, eight inches in the middle. Can't see the grate at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:34:34-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is there anything blocking the drain that you can see, like a pile of leaves or debris?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:34:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can't tell. Under water. Went out Sunday with a rake, couldn't reach it. Wasn't gonna wade in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:34:52-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Smart, don't do that. Let me get this entered. Annandale Road, 226, drain in front of the house, standing water since the storm, over the curb. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:35:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Right in front of 226."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:35:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Do you want a call back when it's scheduled?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:35:16-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, sure. Number's 401-555-0168."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:35:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0168. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:35:22-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me ask. Do the crews work weekends? Because if this sits till Monday, that's another whole stretch of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:35:32-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "After a storm like this they do sometimes get out on weekends for the worst spots, but it depends on what's coming in. I've marked yours as standing water with a walking hazard, which helps move it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:35:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Appreciate that. I'd rather it get done tomorrow, honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:35:55-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Realistically I'd say the next day or two, with a lot of calls after the weekend. If it's getting worse or the water starts toward your house, call back right away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:36:11-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Neighbors are all complaining too. We all watch each other's places, take turns grabbing mail when somebody's away on vacation. So everybody on the street sees this thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:36:25-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, if any of them want to add details, they can call in and reference the same address. More reports on one spot can help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:36:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I'll tell them. Just want somebody out here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:36:42-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. It's in the system now. Anything else I can do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:36:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:36:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Reardon. Hang in there, and stay out of that water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:36:59-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep. Bye."
    }
  ],
